# Built ntfsprogs + libntfs-3g, downloaded sources, pip-installed cmake,
# conda-installed autotools.
# No trailing slash: a worktree usually symlinks these at the main checkout
# rather than rebuilding them, and a trailing slash matches only directories,
# so the symlink showed up as untracked and was easy to commit by accident.
.local
# Built ntfsprogs-plus (its own prefix; both projects install an ntfsck)
.local-plus
# Generated fixture images and manifests
images
# CMake build trees
build/
*/build/
# mkfixtures build outputs
mkfixtures/mkfixtures
mkfixtures/*.dSYM/
